QUESTIONS, ANSWERED
Frequently asked questions
Are the prices fixed?
Prices shown are indicative starting examples only. Final pricing depends on size, material, condition and access.
Is my booking confirmed immediately?
No. Submitting the form sends a request. Newlifer must review and confirm the date and time.
What areas do you cover?
Enter your address or area in the booking form. The service area should be confirmed before launch.
Do you clean every surface?
Not every material is suitable for every method. The surface should be assessed first to help avoid damage.
Can I ask for a custom quote?
Yes. Choose the custom option and describe the surface, approximate size and any visible stains.
How do I change my appointment?
Contact Newlifer directly using the business contact details once they have been added to the website.
